{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-03/1066064/block/singleImage/3279895/df/01KKAZA99AZM4VDQWTY2F6DDGC.png?updatedAt=1795746619\"/><figcaption>大埔警署 (大埔警區fb)</figcaption></figure><p>粉嶺發生縱火案。 今日（27日）凌晨1時21分，沙頭角公路龍躍頭段近萃雲路有一輛挖泥機起火，途人見狀報警。警方和救援人員接報後到場，消防開喉將火救熄。案件中無人受傷，毋須疏散。經初步調查，人員於挖泥機旁發現一瓶天拿水，消防相信起火原因有可疑。警方將案件列作「縱火」，交由大埔警區刑事調查隊第二隊跟進，暫未有人被捕。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T03:43:58.097573+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T02:30:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T18:17:33.899659+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T03:37:14.739678+00:00","content_hash":"eda4e9d2d2180cb92fde169a2461f2024b07e3d2fa919587a955c06927248278","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T03:43:58.097573+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}